'''Shaded''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 2]] or through trading. It cannot be salvaged.
== Appearance ==
Shaded’s blade is this silver-grayish color with a scratchy black shading along it, hence the name. The guard is a dark stone gray with black outlines on it, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
*It is very similar to the knife [[Borders]].

